{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act30side_level_act30side_04_beg",
  "groupId": "act30side",
  "stageId": "act30side_04",
  "title": "Back on Track",
  "storyCode": "RS-4",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act30side/level_act30side_04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "bd271d3e64f7847b0e8a83d1b0bfaee062866f25c3223de751c73cdd36495d43",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "Full house!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slippery Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "Straight flush!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "You little sack of shite, you've been hiding cards, haven't ya?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slippery Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "Why'd I need to hide cards to beat you? Just sit yourself down like a good boy—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silent Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1158_1",
      "text": "Royal flush."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slippery Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "Goddammit, how'd you pull that one off?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silent Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1158_1",
      "text": "Your sleeve, Jack."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slippery Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "Eh? My—How'd you catch that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "Jack, you cheating bastard!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slippery Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "Hey, if you didn't catch me, that's your problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "You want a problem? I'll shove your goddamn head so far up your arse that—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silent Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1158_1",
      "text": "Just shuffle already."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slippery Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "Alright, shuffling, shuffling."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "I've sure got some rotten luck, getting stuck with you sorry lot for this shift."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slippery Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "Doesn't matter who you're on shift with, you're playing cards anyway. And there's only a handful of fellas here who won't try to cheat you. Go on, have a count."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "Hmph."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "At least there hasn't been much to do today."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slippery Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "You can say that again. Back when the old man said he'd take us sightseeing, I didn't believe him for one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slippery Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "Now that it's been a month, I'd say I believe him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silent Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1158_1",
      "text": "It's been good eating and good drinking."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "Certainly has! It feels like my appetite's gone back to when I just enlisted."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sickly Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "Ahhh!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "What the hell are you screaming out for, Charles?! Scared the crap outta me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sickly Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "Bloody hell, I had another nightmare."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sickly Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "Dreamt that I got chopped in half by a Sarkaz sword and all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slippery Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "Gah, thought it'd be something worse. Day afore yesterday I dreamt that I got blown up by some Originium explosives while out scouting."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sickly Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "Right now I'd like to shove some explosives into your gob."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slippery Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "Well hurry up already then."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slippery Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "A guy nuttier than a freaking Vampire out on the battlefield is going to have a few screws loose when off the warfront."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sickly Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "Well, what can I do? I can't control if I have a nightmare or not."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "Just think positive. Last time you said you were being minced, this time you said you were being chopped in two."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "Maybe it's a good omen or something."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sickly Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "Dammit, you're right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slippery Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "Alright, enough moping, grab a drink and come play some cards."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "Perfect timing really. Now that you're up, come take over my spot for a few rounds."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sickly Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "text": "Why, is something the matter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "Not really. There's a few farmers at the bottom of the mountain that need a hand with their work, so I'm going to help out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sickly Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "text": "Farmers?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silent Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1158_1",
      "text": "That family that gives us milk all the time, the Turiels."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slippery Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "Oh, I remember them. Their daughter's quite pretty."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slippery Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "Heh, I see how it is, Lisburn."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "I'm just helping out. Don't read too much into it."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "The hell are you lot doing? Everyone within a hundred meters could hear you yapping away."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "You sure have some skills, turning the barracks into your gambling parlor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slippery Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "Didn't you say we were going to go sightseeing from the start, though?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slippery Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "We're just following orders here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "I told you, you can go help out the locals a bit for some goodwill, let them think we're more than just a bunch of yobs. Have you been yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slippery Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "Lisburn's going to help out. He's keeping mum, but I can tell that he's thinking of settling down here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "Oh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "Don't listen to this nutter, boss. I really am just going there to help out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "After all, we came here to..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "Alright, that's enough out of you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "Just get going already. Who died and made you chief worrywart, huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "If a young lad like yourself really does want to become a family man, I'd say you're still a good egg."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Seasoned Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1157_1",
      "text": "Yes, sir!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slippery Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "You've sure got a stink about you, boss."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slippery Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "Still working on your veterinary medicine out there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "Save it. Lily, the Leones' girl, she gave birth prematurely."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "Didn't get there in time, all I could do was help with some postpartum care."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "*sigh* And then I ran into this one very unlucky chap."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slippery Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "Unlucky?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "Another Victorian."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slippery Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "A Victorian? The whole month we've been here I bet I've seen, if not a thousand Victorian tourists, eight hundred at least."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "Alright, I get it, you love taking a stroll down the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "Deal those cards out already."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silent Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1158_1",
      "text": "I'll deal."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Silent Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1158_1",
      "text": "Charles had a nightmare again, boss."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "Did he?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "Let me see."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sickly Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "text": "It's fine, no use troubling yourself over it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "If you lot die, then who's going to fight for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sickly Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "text": "We're going to fight?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "Shut your mouth for a second and hold still, alright?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sickly Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "text": "Gah—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "Hmm... Well, at least it hasn't gotten worse."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "Does it still hurt as much as last time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sickly Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "text": "It's been a lot better since we came to Kjerag."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "Hmph, I spent a lot of money greasing palms just to get this opportunity. If you lot aren't feeling any healthier, doesn't it seem like I wasted all that dosh for nothing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "Besides, it's not like there's anything else to do here except get better."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sickly Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "text": "Heh, you're right about that, sir."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sickly Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "text": "This arm's been no good for a while, but you've already helped me a lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sickly Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "text": "If I ever lose both my arms, well, at least I can still carry a weapon into battle with my teeth."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "What use is a soldier with no arms?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "There's no need to show off. You lads just need to remember that you're here to—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "Allow me to remind you once more, My Lord."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "You have a duty you are obligated to carry out. Do not fail Her Grace."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Trilby Asher'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "This is not a sightseeing trip."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slippery Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "Hey, boss?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slippery Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "You finally gone senile?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "I'm not the same as you simpletons who care nothing for your health."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "When <i>you've</i> gone senile, I'm still going to be fit as a fiddle."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slippery Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "Hey, we might not even get to live that long."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "*sigh*"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "Forget it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "For the sake of my retirement, this old fogey's willing to go all in."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slippery Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "What are you talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slippery Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "I don't think a hoity-toity lord like you throwing your money around is going to fit in well with the locals, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "But nobody's going to turn down a sumptuous banquet."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Harold",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "text": "You go on and play your cards."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slippery Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "Sure you're not just looking for an excuse to drop a crappy hand?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slippery Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "Let me see..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slippery Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "Four Jacks, not great, not terrible."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "Hah! Now that hits the spot!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "Enciodes sent it over specially, said it would be given out at the bonfire banquet the night before the ceremony. That uh, what was it called again...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "'Karlan Manor's Snow Realm Spring', Sir!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "They've been talking about it on television every day, enough times that I've memorized it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "Pah, it's all just claptrap for the masses!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "I will say that this drink is exquisite. Very robust. I dare say it's the one good thing Enciodes has done."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "However! It hardly holds a candle to our very own aged Paleroche akavit!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "Should we keep drinking this stuff, Sir?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "Counting what we got from the Browntails, there's still three other drinks to try."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "Of course we'll keep drinking it! If we don't try for ourselves then how will we know which is the best?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "Since the Saintess has bestowed the privilege of organizing the banquet on Clan Paleroche, this is of course one of my duties."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "Drink is our top priority! I must pick Kjerag's best spirits for this banquet! I cannot let the Saintess down!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "Alright, go, get the rest of the booze up here for a taste test!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "Yes, Sir!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "Guards, with me! Let's carry up those drinks!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "General, I have a question."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "Although the Patriarch did say that this is all preparation for the ceremony just now, isn't this way too much booze?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "The boys are totally worn out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "You're thinking too much. Completing Kjeragandr's statue is more important than any amount of booze."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "Ask the men to bear with it for a while longer. When everything's settled, I'll treat you all to a fine meal."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "Alright then."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "(The Paleroches could stand to be a bit more attentive.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "(I didn't think infiltrating them would be this easy.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "(Their former patriarch's already brought Rosalind over.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "(Next, I need to check what exactly Clan Paleroche has up its sleeve.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "(Moreover—All this booze... Based off of Arctosz's attitude, is it really all for the banquet?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "(Yet another trail to follow.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "What's with all the lollygagging? Come over and help out already."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "Yes, sir!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "(But if the Paleroches truly are keeping some terrible secret, Rosalind must surely be involved as well.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "(Finding her has become a priority.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "We have arrived."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "Is this your house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "These rooms are pretty big. Are you one of those low-key rich guys? You don't look it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "Hardly. This is merely some family property."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "Ahem. Look here, young lady."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "This house is built right into the mountain. When you begin your climb tomorrow, you can use the shortcut behind it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "Thanks a lot, batyushka."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "I should apologize to you first."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "Eh? But why though?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "I invited you here out of my own selfish desire."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "By Kjeragandr, I should not have hidden this from you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "Why are you all serious all of a sudden?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "I can handle it. Just lay it on me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "Oh, child..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "There is someone I would like you to meet."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "He..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "Master?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "There's a real big guy yelling for you over there, batyushka."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "He your son?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "He's certainly no son of mine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "Give me a moment, young lady."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "What are you doing back, Sir?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "Am I not allowed back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "That's not what I mean!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "It's just... *sigh* It's not a great time for you to be here..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "Great time or not, you're in no place to speak of such things!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "How is Arctosz?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "He... Sir Arctosz, he..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "Out with it already! Speak clearly!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "Yes, sir!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "Sir Arctosz is currently making preparations for the bonfire banquet!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "Don't just give me the good news! What else?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "He's personally checking all the drinks for tomorrow. Right now, he's sampling those from the other regions..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "Rotten boy...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "He said he would give up drinking last month, and now this? Ridiculous!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "If he keeps flip-flopping, how is anyone supposed to trust a word out of his mouth?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "The patriarch is doing this all for the sake of politics. He's fully dedicated to the Saintess..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "Pfah! Sounds like excuses to me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "Haha... Oh, by the way. Who's the girl?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "How rude, Gulo!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "The young lady is Rosalind, my guest."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "Welcome, Madam Rosalind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "(Master, who is Madam Rosalind really?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "(It might just be me, but she looks a bit like Sir Arc—)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "(Shh!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "(I'm not certain of anything yet. Don't ask too many questions just now.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "Gulo, bring the young lady inside first."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "And then... Wherever that oaf Arctosz is, take her to him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "And don't forget to tell your minions to prepare a room and meal for her. Treat her well, or else."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "Yes, Sir!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "Sorry to keep you waiting."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "No biggie."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "You guys finished chatting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "What was it you were going to tell me before that big guy came over?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "Someone you wanted me to meet, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "The man that I wish for you to meet is inside the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "Follow this one inside first. Your meeting with this man will make everything clear."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "What about you, batyushka? Not coming with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "We will meet again soon, child."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "Very soon..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "Please, come with me, Madam Rosalind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "Alright..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "Hey, bratan, your name is Gulo, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "What were you chatting with the old man about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "Something you can't tell me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "C'mon, bratan, say something."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "(*making an X with his fingers*)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "You really can't say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "(*yet another X, followed by a constant barrage of Xs*)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "Urgh... Fine, I'll stop bothering you about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "Anyway, as soon as I meet this guy, I'll know, right? I'm also real curious as to why you two keep staring at my face."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "What, is it 'cause I look like someone, or does someone look like me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "Nah, can't be, the way the old man talked about the guy he wants me to meet, it's like—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "That—It's not—Well, no...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "Alright, calm down, a guy like you couldn't lie your way out of a finbowl."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "Well, <i>I'm</i> not lying, you guys were stealing some real strange glances earlier."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "If you're up to some funny business, it's gonna come down to my fists."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "Weren't we going inside? C'mon already."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gulo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "Ah! Madam Rosalind!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sir Arctosz, Master has brought us a guest...\nSir?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "Wahahaha! This is a fine drink, incredibly fine!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "Come, finish this glass with me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "Hahaha!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "This is the guy the old man wanted me to meet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "A... bearded drunk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "Eh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "What's this girl babbling about?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "I am Arctosz, Patriarch of the Paleroche Clan. How could I possibly get drunk on a sip of wine?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "Hah."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "All the drunks say stuff like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "And here I thought... Nah, couldn't be, my papa would definitely be way cooler."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "You're Father's guest, *hic* so I won't argue with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "Still..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "Come a bit closer, girl. Let me have a proper look."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leto",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "Wha—What the hell are you trying to pull?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "I... I feel like your face is sort of familiar..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Arctosz",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "You're..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "*cough*, *cough*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The old man steps inside, disturbing a thick layer of dust.\nThe door barely hangs on its hinges, and the floor creaks with every step.\nUnder his orders, the room has not welcomed a single guest in a very, very long time.\nWith no residents, and no custodians, this forgotten room has fallen apart with age."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "Where did I put it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "I think it was..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "...Ah, good, here it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The old man fiddles with the latch of a cabinet in the corner, removing something from within.\nIt's a plain, unadorned rock, every edge painstakingly polished smooth until it was perfectly round.\nUpon the rock is carved a blessing of Kjeragandr.\nThe old man grasps the rock in the palm of his hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "Thank goodness..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "I kept it, even as I never expected this day to come."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "Rosalind has grown up well, Tatyana..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The old man remembers. That day was also a winter's day.\nIt was through this very window that he had watched that sad, silent parting.\nHe had seen that young, foreign, faultless woman, with her anger and disappointment that could light snow aflame, leave.\nHe had seen that young, confused child carried in her mother's arms, unable to understand the reason behind her mother's furious face.\nHe had watched them for what felt like centuries.\nWatched them until their backs faded into the bitter white winds."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "So many years, and with so much time passed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "I had planned to give this to Rosalind, but I never expected..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "Arctosz did not want to see you two bear the blame, and so I locked this room, and told him that he must not speak in your stead."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "And then it was I, for the sake of Clan Paleroche, who exiled you and yours."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "If there is anyone to blame, Tatyana, then blame me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "Now, the Paleroche clan is in Arctosz's hands."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "Kjerag too, is not as she once was."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "I pledged to live the rest of my days as a simple devotee, so that as long as I lived, I would keep the road ahead clear for Kjeragandr."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "If only it had been like this..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "I must be truly old now, daydreaming like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "By Kjeragandr."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elder Devotee",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "By Kjeragandr..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
